        "texto": "Beheading enemies is a very ancient custom. Thus David cut off the head of Goliath and carried it to Saul (1SAm. 17:51,57). So also the Philistines cut off the head of Saul (1 Sam. 31:9). Layard found at Nineveh representations of scenes which well illustrate the text. Heads of s…"
      },
      "c-6ce3c7c955690084": {
